fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266VUIParams","fragment":"\n\tGstH266VUIParams\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266VUIParams\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266VUIParams\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 VUI parameters.\nflag to indicate the progressive type of stream.\nflag to indicate the interlaced type of stream.\nindicate the presence of frame packing\narrangement sei message\nflag to indicate the projected support.\nspecifies whether aspect_ratio_idc is present.\nspecifies whether the ratio is constant.\nspecifies the value of the sample aspect ratio of\nthe luma samples.\nindicates the horizontal size of the sample aspect ratio.\nindicates the vertical size of the sample aspect ratio.\nspecify whether the overscan_appropriate_flag\nis present.\nindicates whether the cropped decoded pictures\noutput are suitable for display using overscan.\nspecifies whether colour_primaries,\ntransfer_characteristics and matrix_coefficients are present.\nindicates the chromaticity coordinates of the source\nprimaries.\nindicates the opto-electronic\ntransfer characteristic.\ndescribes the matrix coefficients used in deriving\nluma and chroma signals.\nindicates the full range of the color.\nspecifies whether chroma_sample_loc_type_frame,\nchroma_sample_loc_type_top_field and chroma_sample_loc_type_bottom_field\nare present.\nspecify the location of chroma for the frame.\nspecify the location of chroma for the\ntop field.\nspecify the location of chroma for the\nbottom field.\ncalculated aspect ratio numerator value.\ncalculated aspect ratio denominator value.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 VUI parameters.\nflag to indicate the progressive type of stream.\nflag to indicate the interlaced type of stream.\nindicate the presence of frame packing\narrangement sei message\nflag to indicate the projected support.\nspecifies whether aspect_ratio_idc is present.\nspecifies whether the ratio is constant.\nspecifies th